ops in your garden to cook up delicious recipes, and care for the cuddliest of animals to gain rare resources. Form a true bond by meeting all their needs, and they will even protect you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660080/extras/81c830092184a76c0e41c4c7a02cfdae.webp?t=1788218433\" width=780 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660080/extras/01f40f8d131781c33a246aa54b20b02c.poster.avif?t=1788218433\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660080/extras/01f40f8d131781c33a246aa54b20b02c.webm?t=1788218433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660080/extras/01f40f8d131781c33a246aa54b20b02c.mp4?t=1788218433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creativity lies at the heart of Aloft, which can be enjoyed as a peaceful solo experience or with up to 7 other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your entire island base when you join another player’s world, and create a small village of sky explorers. Use the in-game island creator to design anything you can imagine, then share it with the community to populate their worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the island of your dreams, challenge the corruption, restore balance, and express your creativity in the limitless skies of Aloft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the clouds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660080/extras/fdd5a853360389fbd57ea95247b5c840.avif?t=1788218433\" widt